        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2006-12-08/pdf/06-9632.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 9A(c) of the RLA, \nfrom the date of the creation of the Board and for 120 days thereafter, \nno change in the conditions out of which the disputes arose shall be made \nby the parties to the controversy, except by agreement of the parties. \nVerDate Aug<31>2005 17:21 Dec 07, 2006 Jkt 211001 PO 00000 Frm 00003 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\08DEE0.SGM 08DEE0jlentini on PROD1PC65 with FRE0\n=== PDF page 2 of 3 ===\n71460 Federal Register / Vol. 71, No. 236 / Friday, December 8, 2006 / Presidential Documents"
    },
